---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
isHomepage: true
title: Nashville Music Producer & Audio Engineer | Caleb Kuhlmann
description: Nashville music producer and audio engineer Caleb Kuhlmann offers production, mixing, recording, and audio consulting for alternative, pop, rock, and independent artists.
---
{% include "components/site-header.njk" %}

<main id="main-content" class="homepage">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Nashville, TN · available locally and remotely</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Music production, mixing, and audio engineering <span class="hero-frequency">in service of the song.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">Caleb Kuhlmann is a Nashville-based producer and audio engineer helping artists bring their music to life.</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a class="button-link" href="#selected-work">Listen to My Work</a>
      <a data-cursor-tail class="text-cta" href="/contact/#project-inquiry">Start a Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="homepage-section about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="section-heading">About</h2>
      <p>I’m a Nashville-based music producer, mix engineer, and audio technician with experience across studio recording, live production, artist development, and creative technology.</p>
      <p>That range has made me attentive to both musical decisions and the practical systems around them: how a room feels, how a session moves, and what helps an artist stay present.</p>
      <p>My work is grounded in performance, arrangement, tone, and collaboration. I’m less interested in forcing every project toward the same polished template than in finding what makes a song or artist distinct and building around it.</p>
      <p data-cursor-tail>I work primarily across alternative, pop, rock, singer-songwriter, and adjacent styles, both locally and remotely.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-image" tabindex="0">
      <picture>
        {% set portraitSizes = "auto, (max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), 300px" %}
        <source type="image/avif" sizes="{{ portraitSizes }}" srcset="/assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-400.avif 400w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-800.avif 800w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-1120.avif 1120w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-1400.avif 1400w">
        <source type="image/webp" sizes="{{ portraitSizes }}" srcset="/assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-400.webp 400w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-1400.webp 1400w">
        <img src="/assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-800.jpg" srcset="/assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-400.jpg 400w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-800.jpg 800w, /assets/images/caleb-kuhlmann-studio-1400.jpg 1400w" sizes="{{ portraitSizes }}" alt="Caleb Kuhlmann working in a recording studio" width="1400" height="1750" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>
      <figcaption class="eyebrow">Portra 400</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section id="selected-work" class="homepage-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <p class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
    <h2 id="work-title" class="section-heading">Featured Work</h2>
    <div class="featured-work">
      {% for project in featuredWork %}
      <article class="work-item">
        <div class="work-index" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div>
          <p class="work-artist">{{ project.artist }}</p>
          <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
          <p class="work-role">{{ project.role }}</p>
          <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
          {% if project.url %}<a class="inline-link" href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Listen to project <span class="visually-hidden">by {{ project.artist }}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-link"><a data-cursor-tail class="inline-link" href="/credits/">View Full Credits <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="homepage-section" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <p class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
    <h2 id="services-title" class="section-heading">Services</h2>
    <div class="services-list">
      {% for service in services %}
      <article id="{{ service.id }}"><h3>{{ service.label | escape }}</h3><p>{{ service.description | escape }}</p></article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-link"><a data-cursor-tail class="inline-link" href="/contact/#project-inquiry">Ask About a Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </section>

  {# <aside class="listening-for" aria-labelledby="listening-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Working philosophy</p>
    <h2 id="listening-title">In the end...</h2>
    <p>It all starts with a great song and a good hang. Whatever the genre, the records that last begin with people listening closely and building around something worth saying.</p>
  </aside> #}

  <section class="final-cta" aria-labelledby="project-title">
    <h2 id="project-title">Making something that needs the right set of ears?</h2>
    <p>Tell me what you’re working on, where the project stands, and what kind of help you’re looking for.</p>
    <a data-cursor-tail class="button-link" href="/contact/#project-inquiry">Start a Project</a>
  </section>
</main>
